     anchors at seal (tables.md "Derived items"); names, prices, gates and effects are ours.
     Daidara lists a derived row as it lists its anchor: the Linings follow the normally
     stocked Chain Mail anchor. The Wards are T2 (design 7.4: one-leaf reduction) and
     wait for Marukyu Striptease: their first
     gate is three Idle Stone Iron (0x52B, first dropped on the Striptease floors) sold to
